---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/navigation/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/navigation/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="TRAI, DND, DLT & DPDP Compliance | Shris AI"
  description="India regulatory controls for the Shris AI voice workforce: 9am–9pm calling windows, DND scrub, DLT templates, AI disclosure, and DPDP."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="legal-main">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <div class="eyebrow-container">
          <div class="eyebrow-line"></div>
          <p class="eyebrow-text">India Regulatory Runtime</p>
          <div class="eyebrow-line"></div>
        </div>
        <h1>Compliance is a gate, not a footnote.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Every outbound dispatch in Shris-ai-app is evaluated against TRAI commercial hours, DND preference, DLT registration, AI disclosure, and DPDP purpose limitation before a SIP trunk is seized.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2">
        <article class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-indigo">TRAI</span>
          <h2>09:00–21:00 IST</h2>
          <p>Default commercial outbound voice is permitted only between 9am and 9pm Asia/Kolkata. Dispatches outside the window are queued for the next legal slot and logged as compliance.blocked.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-indigo">DND</span>
          <h2>Preference scrub</h2>
          <p>Numbers are checked against the National Customer Preference Register before dial. DND hits never leave the orchestrator.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-emerald">DLT</span>
          <h2>PE–TM templates</h2>
          <p>WhatsApp and SMS follow-ups for Indian traffic require registered DLT headers and template IDs bound to the tenant principal entity.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-emerald">AI disclosure</span>
          <h2>Spoken notice</h2>
          <p>Agents identify as an AI voice worker of the tenant brand on connect, with the utterance stored on the call audit record.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-indigo">DPDP</span>
          <h2>Personal data</h2>
          <p>Audio and transcripts are purpose-limited. Erasure and access requests route to the tenant administrator. Cross-border transfer is off by default.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card-light">
          <span class="badge badge-indigo">Encryption</span>
          <h2>TLS 1.3 / AES-256</h2>
          <p>Media SRTP, APIs TLS 1.3, optional ZDR after CRM sync. Full statement on <a href="/security">Security</a>.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="card-dark" style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
        <h2 style="color: #fff;">Inspect the gate in the console</h2>
        <p style="color: #94A3B8;">The operations workspace shows TRAI window status in real time and will refuse a simulated dispatch that fails the policy engine.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0.75rem;margin-top:1.25rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/app" class="btn btn-indigo">Open Console</a>
          <a href="/docs/trai-dnd-dlt" class="btn btn-outline" style="color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">Read TRAI docs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-main { padding-top: 6.5rem; padding-bottom: 4.5rem; }
  .legal-main h1 { color: var(--shris-navy-950); }
  .legal-main h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin: 0.85rem 0 0.5rem; color: var(--shris-navy-950); }
  .legal-main p { color: var(--shris-tx-secondary); line-height: 1.65; }
  .legal-main a { color: var(--shris-indigo); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
